## Reproduce

```
pip install -e .
vybbench score
```

<!-- TODO: one line — recomputes every published number offline, no keys. -->

## Add your model

We are happy to include your model.

```python
from vybbench.model import Model, Start

class MyModel(Model):
    name = "mymodel"

    def generate(self, prompt: str, width: int, height: int) -> bytes: ...
    def edit(self, instruction: str, start: Start) -> bytes: ...
```

```
vybbench run --model mypkg.mymodel:MyModel   # your model's keys
vybbench judge                               # GEMINI_API_KEY
vybbench score                               # no keys
```

